stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> Verifying: user adds SMTP

    Verifying --> Rejected: AUTH fails<br/>or From misaligned + p=reject
    Rejected --> [*]: never created

    Verifying --> Active: connect + STARTTLS + AUTH<br/>+ DNS gate passes

    Active --> Paused: throttle<br/>or daily limit reached
    Paused --> Active: auto-clears<br/>(reason-scoped)

    Active --> Quarantined: auth_failure
    Active --> Quarantined: N consecutive failures
    Active --> Quarantined: failure rate over window<br/>(min ~20 samples)

    Quarantined --> Active: credential updated<br/><b>auto-clears</b>
    Quarantined --> Active: user un-quarantine<br/><i>rate limited ~3/day</i>
    Quarantined --> Active: test button verifies<br/><b>bypasses rate limit</b>

    Active --> Suspended: operator suspends user<br/>or subscription lapses
    Quarantined --> Suspended: same
    Paused --> Suspended: same
    Suspended --> Active: reinstated<br/>(lossless, same jobs resume)

    Active --> Deleted: user deletes
    Quarantined --> Deleted: user deletes
    Deleted --> [*]: purged after retention window

    note right of Quarantined
        User-resettable circuit breaker,
        not module 2's operator-only lockout.
        Excluded from routing while here.
    end note

    note right of Deleted
        Credential still exists during
        the retention window, so routing
        MUST exclude deleted accounts.
    end note
